Means a ticket we have issued to you in conjunction with another ticket that together constitute a single contract of carriage.

Montreal Convention

Convention for the Unification of Certain Rules for International Carriage by Air signed at Montreal on 28 May 1999 (hereinafter referred to as the Montreal Convention).

